{"id":335,"date":"2020-11-19T14:02:20","date_gmt":"2020-11-19T19:02:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.fm1.dev\/?post_type=bio&#038;p=335"},"modified":"2025-07-01T16:15:07","modified_gmt":"2025-07-01T20:15:07","slug":"dr-alexandra-tarvin","status":"publish","type":"bio","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/bio\/dr-alexandra-tarvin\/","title":{"rendered":"Dr. Alexandra Tarvin"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Au.D., the founder of Elevate Audiology, is a highly skilled audiologist dedicated to personalized patient care. With expertise in evaluating and treating hearing disorders, fitting hearing aids and advising on tinnitus management, she is recognized as a leading professional in the field.<br>&nbsp;<br>Dr. Tarvin earned her Doctor of Audiology from the University of South Florida and holds a bachelor\u2019s degree in communication sciences and disorders from the University of Florida.<br><br>Dr. Tarvin\u2019s commitment to advancing audiology knowledge is showcased through her&nbsp;published research and presentations at state and national conferences.<br>&nbsp;<br>As a certified fellow of the Tinnitus Practitioners Association and a member of the American Tinnitus Association, Dr. Tarvin specializes in tinnitus and sound sensitivity. Her dedication extends beyond clinical practice; she actively contributes to state and national professional organizations, volunteering in leadership roles and advocating for increased access to audiology services within the healthcare system at the state and federal level. She has been instrumental in developing an audiology clinic at the Samaritan Health Center in Pickens County, providing services to those that would otherwise not be able to receive them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Recognized for her advocacy efforts, Dr. Tarvin received an award in 2017 from the Academy of Doctors of Audiology. Her passion for enhancing audiology awareness and services is demonstrated through active participation in lobbying endeavors. Originally from Queens, NY, Dr. Tarvin resides in Greenville with her husband, a veteran, their son, Miles and their dog, Colby.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dr. Tarvin is licensed to practice in South Carolina and North Carolina.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dr. Alexandra Tarvin, Au.D., the founder of Elevate Audiology, is a highly skilled audiologist dedicated to personalized patient care. With expertise in evaluating and treating hearing disorders, fitting hearing aids and advising on tinnitus management, she is recognized as a leading professional in the field.&nbsp;Dr. Tarvin earned her Doctor of Audiology from the University of&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":32531,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","schema":"","fname":"Alexandra","lname":"Tarvin","position":"Audiologist","credentials":"Au.D.","placeID":"","no_match":false,"name":"","company":"","review":"","address":"","city":"","state":"","zip":"","lat":"","lng":"","phone1":"","phone2":"","fax":"","mon1":"","mon2":"","tue1":"","tue2":"","wed1":"","wed2":"","thu1":"","thu2":"","fri1":"","fri2":"","sat1":"","sat2":"","sun1":"","sun2":"","hours-note":"","footnotes":""},"bio_category":[],"hospital_affiliation":[],"class_list":["post-335","bio","type-bio","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/bio\/335","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/bio"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/bio"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/bio\/335\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/32531"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.